name: MyOS Document Operation Mandate
type: Mandate/Operation Mandate
description: >
  MyOS-hosted operation mandate allowing sessions of
  authorizedInitialDocument to ask MyOS Admin to write the inherited target
  Operation Request. The canonical subtype constrains the inherited guarantor
  and authorized-actor roles to MyOS Admin.

authorizedInitialDocument:
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Initial document whose sessions may request the operation call.
